Third-party components

There are NO runtime dependencies: the application ships as plain HTML5, CSS
and JavaScript, and uses only files served from the same origin (plus Google's
Firebase Authentication endpoints at runtime and, for the Google sign-in button
only, the Firebase JS SDK loaded from www.gstatic.com).

Development-only:
  - jsdom (MIT licence) — used by tests/smoke-test.js. Not shipped.

Brand assets (logo, green #187800, sage #9CCC84, wordmark red #C00000) are
taken from efpl.org and remain the property of EnerFab (Pvt) Ltd.
